#
# Fail-witness for ex:saNoLogicToGmeowAxiomEdge: an axiom edge out of the
# standalone kernel into a domain class, which is a genuine dependency cycle
# because the domain layer already depends on the reasoning layer.
@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

logic:Enactment rdfs:subClassOf gmeow:Event .
